<title>USA: Evans Inc Q4 March 1 loss vs profit.</title>
<headline>Evans Inc Q4 March 1 loss vs profit.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr	loss	    $0.38   profit	 $1.02</p>
